{"resourceIdentifier":"5137","resourceName":"Grand Katanga Reforestation Project","description":"The Grand Katanga Reforestation Project is an Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation (ARR) grouped project that aims to restore large areas of degraded land through reforestation of native tree species, including enrichment planting and assisted natural regeneration in the Grand Katanga region of the Democratic Republic of Congo (DR Congo). \r\nThe project proponent, Carbon Ventures Africa (CVA), partners with rural communities that have long-term rights to substantial areas of degraded and deforested land that could benefit from reforestation. The project finances the re-establishment of long-term maintenance and protection of native Miombo woodlands by local communities. In parallel, the project finances complementary investments in the local communities including improved agriculture and the planting of fast-growing species for sustainable charcoal production, thereby addressing the two main causes of deforestation in the region.\r\nThe project achieves durable, high-integrity GHG removals through nature-based sequestering of carbon dioxide (CO2), resulting from the net biomass growth in successfully implemented reforestation areas, and establishment of vegetation on degraded forestlands, bare soils, and degraded agricultural lands. The project is also seeking the certification to Climate, Community & Biodiversity (CCB) standards as a result of its positive impacts on climate change, local communities and biodiversity.","location":{"latitude":-10.962917,"longitude":28.168350},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5137"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Haut-Lomami"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Ventures Africa Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"London, United Kingdom"},{"type":"string","value":"00442070997032"},{"type":"string","value":"andrew.gaines.gkrp@carbonventures.africa"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"489033"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0047"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"125986 Hectares"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 03/08/2023 - 02/08/2073"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Ventures Africa Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"London, United Kingdom"},{"type":"string","value":"00442070997032"},{"type":"string","value":"andrew.gaines.gkrp@carbonventures.africa"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Project withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"489033"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"125986 Hectares"}]},{"code":"CCB_STANDARD_EDITION_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CCB Third Edition"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=118651&IDKEY=i0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f163619729","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_DRAFT_5137_22Jul2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-09-11T16:52:22.29Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=115766